# MongoDB

- One database for the Cherry platform. Generated customer apps may use their own stores on disk; do not write customer app data into Cherry collections except job metadata.
- Collections: users, organizations, memberships, devices, sessions, verificationCodes, tempMailboxes, projects, jobs, llmModels, llmVersions, auditEvents.
- `tempMailboxes` and `verificationCodes` are first-party (our mailer). No AgentMail documents.
- User delete is a first-class path (KVKK/GDPR). Cascade or anonymize; never leave orphan PII.
- Hash secrets (passwords, TOTP seeds, device fingerprints). Store 6-digit codes hashed with TTL.
- Indexes for email, org id, session token hash, job status, audit subject.
- Read [docs/database.md](docs/database.md) before adding a collection.
